<h2 local-id=3D"104ac63c2f87" id=3D"CR213-TestPlan-Purpose"><span data-colo=
rid=3D"ws15tgk267">Purpose</span></h2>
<p local-id=3D"501a7900d70e">The purpose of this test plan is to validate t=
he configuration changes introduced by <strong>CR213 - New Movies 24 &amp; =
Syfy Budget Lines</strong>, ensuring that:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1cc506da-e101-4fb4-bcf6-a339f470d59f">
<li local-id=3D"6a602019-401d-4628-92e6-e153a923921c">
<p local-id=3D"bb75af0e3cb9">Correct <strong>G/L Codes</strong> are used fo=
r Movies 24 and Syfy.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"76aaaa66-95a0-4529-b9a7-83033f40b622">
<p local-id=3D"3a5dab320e62">Correct <strong>SAP Profit Centres</strong> ar=
e applied.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aa9a79fa-f1f1-491f-992f-8d566bdfca77">
<p local-id=3D"49d2ee683bca">New <strong>WBS instructions</strong> sent fro=
m RightsLogic to SAP use <strong>Company Code 2000</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3acfda6c-acb1-4e44-92c4-2d38a8abf33c">
<p local-id=3D"2d1e9245b2f5">No regression is introduced to existing Rights=
=E2=80=91In=E2=80=91Finance functionality.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"1bcf97cf7fb1" id=3D"CR213-TestPlan-Scope"><span data-colori=
d=3D"b5yjx3ex2n">Scope</span></h2>
<h4 local-id=3D"de5c9e2b5357" id=3D"CR213-TestPlan-InScope">In Scope</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"5ef2723b-878c-4b79-8cd3-62a4211db383">
<li local-id=3D"4e1d1d6b-2d2f-43ca-be33-c5e79a20dc31">
<p local-id=3D"3dc05ff11409">RightsLogic <strong>Rights=E2=80=91In=E2=80=91=
Finance</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b99fa876-34c9-47cf-8a13-514c12b222b9">
<p local-id=3D"d5d0e5d4ee1c">Maintenance =E2=86=92 <strong>Transaction Dict=
ionary</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cadc92c4-d799-45c5-838c-bb29e7fe6417">
<p local-id=3D"c79668de8994"><strong>Contract Status Mapping, Budget &amp; =
COA</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a6ae636b-6038-4c28-954b-2b5b78b8b8fd">
<p local-id=3D"6be9654441a0">SAP WBS instruction generation for:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b025a796-9435-4ed1-92ac-4d56273f50bc">
<li local-id=3D"0345acd8-4031-42af-b090-a117d59da6e3">
<p local-id=3D"e13acdf0294d">Movies 24</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35f9fba9-50ad-4db7-9a4e-6f0e0bdf908d">
<p local-id=3D"6814cbfbb0e9">Syfy</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
