</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"823d1638-57da-4cf6-8d57-b301b87cea5f">
<li local-id=3D"794a4dd7-f712-4b6a-a5aa-c284aa70c6e2">
<p local-id=3D"e25397c5e873">Migration of existing WBS codes in SAP (manual=
 activity by Sky)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bc38d89f-a035-4f4b-9021-9c5491596847">
<p local-id=3D"75fa6ee0236f">Reallocation of historical GL postings</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"1fd3632d-7eba-4282-93cc-1490499e13ad">
<p local-id=3D"5b48aadd8c89">Validation of SAP-side postings</p></li>
</ul>
