<h3 local-id=3D"e31498f5a0a6" id=3D"CR213-TestPlan-Movies24-SAPProfitCentre=
Update">Movies 24 - SAP Profit Centre Update</h3>
<p local-id=3D"473a18807f05"><strong>Objective:</strong><br>
Ensure Movies 24 uses <strong>Sky Movies</strong> as the SAP Profit Centre.=
</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1234" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"00de4be9-a4be-4b94-b48b-306e70caaabd" class=3D"confluenceTable">
